th if proposal is successful","_callValue":"- amount of wei to pass with function call if a token transfer is involved","_description":"- Text description of proposal to be emitted in event ","_functionSignature":"- function signature of the function to be executed if proposal is successful","_name":"- Text name of proposal to be emitted in event","_targetContractRegistryKey":"- Registry key for the contract concerning this proposal"},"return":"- ID of new proposal"},"submitVote(uint256,uint8)":{"params":{"_proposalId":"- id of the proposal this vote is for","_vote":"- can be either {Yes, No} from Vote enum. No other values allowed"}},"transferGuardianship(address)":{"details":"Only callable by current guardian","params":{"_newGuardianAddress":"- new guardian address"}},"updateVote(uint256,uint8)":{"params":{"_proposalId":"- id of the proposal this vote is for","_vote":"- can be either {Yes, No} from Vote enum. No other values allowed"}},"vetoProposal(uint256)":{"params":{"_proposalId":"- id of the proposal"}}}},"userdoc":{"methods":{"evaluateProposalOutcome(uint256)":{"notice":"Once the voting period + executionDelay for a proposal has ended, evaluate the outcome and     execute the proposal if voting quorum met & vote passes.     To pass, stake-weighted vote must be > 50% Yes."},"getDelegateManagerAddress()":{"notice":"Get the DelegateManager address"},"getExecutionDelay()":{"notice":"Get the proposal execution delay"},"getGuardianAddress()":{"notice":"Get the contract Guardian address"},"getInProgressProposals()":{"notice":"Get the array of all InProgress proposal Ids"},"getMaxInProgressProposals()":{"notice":"Get the max number of concurrent InProgress proposals"},"getProposalById(uint256)":{"notice":"Get proposal information by proposal Id"},"getProposalTargetContractHash(uint256)":{"notice":"Get proposal target contract hash by proposalId"},"getRegistryAddress()":{"notice":"Get the registry address"},"getServiceProviderFactoryAddress()":{"notice":"Get the ServiceProviderFactory address"},"getStakingAddress()":{"notice":"Get the Staking address"},"getVoteInfoByProposalAndVoter(uint256,address)":{"notice":"Get vote direction and vote magnitude for a given proposal and voter"},"getVotingPeriod()":{"notice":"Get the contract voting period"},"getVotingQuorumPercent()":{"notice":"Get the contract voting quorum percent"},"guardianExecuteTransaction(bytes32,uint256,string,bytes)":{"notice":"Allows the guardianAddress to execute protocol actions"},"inProgressProposalsAreUpToDate()":{"notice":"Returns false if any proposals in inProgressProposals array are evaluatable         Evaluatable = proposals with closed votingPeriod"},"initialize()":{"notice":"wrapper function around parent contract Initializable's `initializable` modifier     initializable modifier ensures this function can only be called once by each deployed child contract     sets isInitialized flag to true to which is used by _requireIsInitialized()"},"initialize(address,uint256,uint256,uint256,uint16,address)":{"notice":"Initialize the Governance contract"},"isGovernanceAddress()":{"notice":"Used to check if is governance contract before setting governance address in other contracts"},"setDelegateManagerAddress(address)":{"notice":"Set the DelegateManager address"},"setExecutionDelay(uint256)":{"notice":"Set the execution delay for a proposal"},"setMaxInProgressProposals(uint16)":{"notice":"Set the max number of concurrent InProgress proposals"},"setRegistryAddress(address)":{"notice":"Set the Registry address"},"setServiceProviderFactoryAddress(address)":{"notice":"Set the ServiceProviderFactory address"},"setStakingAddress(address)":{"notice":"Set the Staking address"},"setVotingPeriod(uint256)":{"notice":"Set the voting period for a Governance proposal"},"setVotingQuorumPercent(uint256)":{"notice":"Set the voting quorum percentage for a Governance proposal"},"submitProposal(bytes32,uint256,string,bytes,string,string)":{"notice":"Submit a proposal for vote. Only callable by addresses with non-zero total active stake.     total active stake = total active deployer stake + total active delegator stake "},"submitVote(uint256,uint8)":{"notice":"Vote on an active Proposal. Only callable by addresses with non-zero active stake."},"transferGuardianship(address)":{"notice":"Change the guardian address"},"updateVote(uint256,uint8)":{"notice":"Update previous vote on an active Proposal. Only callable by addresses with non-zero active stake."},"vetoProposal(uint256)":{"notice":"Action limited to the guardian address that can veto a proposal"}}}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"Governance.sol":"Governance"},"evmVersion":"istanbul","libraries":{},"optimizer":{"enabled":true,"runs":200},"remappings":[]},"sources":{"Governance.sol":{"keccak256":"0xc947c6c7bd43a5f29dc3583924a9f1086f99d59815df6c9c684724d2dfe084df","urls":["bzz-raw://d9f7d7d9bc54e3885768c496f13f130109900da9f01dec87d31c6fd57576ac67","dweb:/ipfs/QmQAiEVXCokSXwU94aZGbm1bAXGJGpWe28DBHQZDeRxs8y"]}},"version":1}